#### old-eno-suffix — P12: `.ENO` is not network text
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := f(a).ENO;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_PARSE `.ENO` is not network text

#### old-if-then — P12/B4b: IF … THEN is gone
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  IF a AND b THEN JMP Done; END_IF;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_PARSE IF … THEN is gone

#### old-plus — P12: ST's `+` is not network text
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION FBD
NETWORK
  x := (a + b);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION write ADD

